      "description": "USD attributed to relay workers over the range. \u26a0\ufe0f Aggregated with `max_over_time`, NOT `increase`. These are per-session cumulative counters that expire 15m after their last sample, so a short relay phase can expose only its first nonzero sample and `increase()` would treat that as the baseline and report ~0. `max_over_time` takes each session series' final value; summing across sessions gives the true total. Same pattern as operator-usage.json.",
