      "title": "Container runners seen",
      "description": "One row per container instance. cloud_* / container_id / service_instance_id are OTel semconv fields, verified to survive the CF tunnel into both Loki and Prometheus. Empty until container runners ship. \u26a0\ufe0f Aggregated with `max_over_time`, NOT `increase`. These are per-session cumulative counters that expire 15m after their last sample, so a short relay phase can expose only its first nonzero sample and `increase()` would treat that as the baseline and report ~0. `max_over_time` takes each session series' final value; summing across sessions gives the true total. Same pattern as operator-usage.json.",
